WEBVTT

00:05:30.117 --> 00:05:34.121
Deep down, they want to know
that their lives have mattered.

00:05:35.456 --> 00:05:37.750
They feel really mortal.

00:05:38.417 --> 00:05:39.752
Because they are.

00:05:40.669 --> 00:05:41.837
As am I.

00:05:42.671 --> 00:05:43.839
As are you.

00:05:45.549 --> 00:05:48.344
So when we learn a loved one may be dying,

00:05:48.386 --> 00:05:50.513
we face a pivotal choice.

00:05:50.554 --> 00:05:52.598
We can choose to say nothing

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:55.976
and hope that our words
will sufficiently honor the person

00:05:56.018 --> 00:05:58.396
who's no longer here with us.

00:05:59.355 --> 00:06:03.025
Or we can step up and express
our love and appreciation